  "x-cross-field-invariants": [
    "Reject duplicate JSON keys, NaN/Infinity, non-integral timestamps and booleans as integer fields; bounded message length before parsing.",
    "All nested context fields must equal the top-level context and active negotiated BOOT/profile/session; unknown fields or enums reject.",
    "Re-encode/reparse wire_frame_hex with ABI3 CRC/length/type; header sequence/config_epoch/tick and payload must exactly match envelope.",
    "TELEM count is50 for fast_9600 and800 for stress_300; sample windows are actual acquisition windows, not receipt times.",
    "Intervals satisfy0<=lower<=upper; unknown intervals are null and block motion. Native EM interval remains null without verified source phase.",
    "Candidates complete no later than host now; candidate/command ids cannot roll back or wrap within a session. Latest completed mailbox never revives consumed or retired work.",
    "Duration <=3000ms FAST or <=12000ms STRESS; action STOP requires all target fields zero and may carry null observation. SET_TARGET requires a nonnull fresh actual FPGA observation in formal HIL/PC_DIRECT.",
    "Validate target combined curvature and zero-speed q rule; preserve first-send/original TTL and monotonically shrinking deadline under host_timing_contract.md.",
    "Grant producers are authenticated by process/pipe ACL, not by the kind string; ai_controller/broker cannot write the grant pipe.",
    "HIL/topology1 usesboard_capture and nonnullcapture_seq; PC_DIRECT/topology2 usespc_direct_host and nullcapture_seq; topology3 isprotectivebaseline, notcomplete-routeclaim.",
    "Pose quaternion finite, unit and xyzw; uncertain odometry contains only self pose. Gate centers must lie on selected faces with full-circle clearance and equal radii; geometry legality does not prove reachability.",
    "No controller inputs may contain obstacle IDs/geometry/type/labels, hidden-map seeds, editor history, future sensors, collision queries, screenshots or precomputed hidden routes.",
    "board_response is hardware_bridge-to-world_authority only, never a controller/model input. Decode ABI3 CRC and exact type/length; only STATE(8), CONFIG_ACK(9), GAIN_ACK(11), BOOT_ACK(13), ACK3D(15), STATE3D(16). The decoded session and applicable epoch must match context; current response/request/observation history and capture/TTL are independently checked by authority before any grant.",
    "For BOOT_ACK, context is the proposed stopped-state negotiation, not an already-enabled context. Exact complete BOOT/profile echo and fresh session are required before activating it. A stored measurement hash is a reference, never authentication or a substitute for verified measurement content; null timing/capture evidence cannot authorize HIL motion.",
    "STATE(8) is a 32-byte physical GAIN or PC_DIRECT health/clock heartbeat. It never provides three-axis motion capture, observed_seq, sample freshness, or a renewed motion deadline. PC_DIRECT STATE requires physical_capture_record_sha256=null; fault state is forwarded for authority to stop."
  ],
  "x-authority-only-kinds": [
    "board_response"
  ]
}
